</span> <span begin="26.821" end="27.409">city</span> <span begin="27.409" end="27.911">again</span> <span begin="27.911" end="28.268">to</span><span begin="28.268" end="28.471">day</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">又一次掠过城市的天际</span></p><p begin="28.841" end="30.737" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.841" end="29.081">I</span> <span begin="29.081" end="29.192">get</span> <span begin="29.192" end="29.357">to</span> <span begin="29.357" end="29.647">see</span> <span begin="29.647" end="29.772">a</span> <span begin="29.772" end="30.157">smile</span> <span begin="30.157" end="30.737">again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">又能望见那抹笑颜</span></p><p begin="31.847" end="35.562" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.847" end="32.497">Nothing</span> <span begin="32.497" end="32.647">in</span> <span begin="32.647" end="32.842">the</span> <span begin="32.842" end="33.172">world</span> <span begin="33.172" end="33.572">could</span> <span begin="33.572" end="33.937">take</span> <span begin="33.937" end="34.312">its</span> <span begin="34.312" end="35.562">place</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">绽放着世间万物无可比拟的色彩</span></p><p begin="36.563" end="39.338" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.563" end="36.998">Cutting</span> <span begin="36.998" end="37.262">through</span> <span begin="37.262" end="37.504">the</span> <span begin="37.504" end="38.620">gentle</span> <span begin="38.620" end="39.338">breeze</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">穿行在柔和的微风里</span></p><p begin="39.338" end="42.402" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.338" end="39.690">Rest</span><span begin="39.690" end="40.073">ing</span> <span begin="40.073" end="40.271">in</span> <span begin="40.271" end="40.525">the</span> <span begin="40.525" end="41.062">sun</span><span begin="41.062" end="41.613">light&apos;s</span> <span begin="41.613" end="42.402">ease</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">歇息在和煦的阳光中</span></p><p begin="42.775" end="47.540" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.775" end="42.934">Day</span> <span begin="42.934" end="43.115">like</span> <span begin="43.115" end="43.314">this</span> <span begin="43.314" end="43.864">means</span> <span begin="43.864" end="44.103">so</span> <span begin="44.103" end="44.884">much</span> <span begin="44.884" end="45.351">more</span> <span begin="45.351" end="45.535">to</span> <span begin="45.535" end="45.961">me</span> <span begin="45.961" end="46.315">right</span> <span begin="46.315" end="47.540">now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这样的日子，于我而言格外珍贵</span></p><p begin="48.412" end="54.353" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.412" end="48.755">God,</span><span begin="48.755" end="49.137">I</span> <span begin="49.137" end="49.422">wish</span> <span begin="49.422" end="50.018">these</span> <span begin="50.018" end="50.521">days</span> <span begin="50.521" end="51.336">would</span> <span begin="51.336" end="52.487">never</span> <span begin="52.487" end="53.593">fade</span> <span begin="53.593" end="54.353">away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">天啊，愿这夏日的余韵永不褪去</span></p><p begin="54.563" end="57.348" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.563" end="54.720">A</span> <span begin="54.720" end="55.083">letter</span> <span begin="55.083" end="55.268">is</span> <span begin="55.268" end="55.498">a</span> <span begin="55.498" end="56.074">piece</span> <span begin="56.074" end="56.422">of</span> <span begin="56.422" end="56.799">the</span> <span begin="56.799" end="57.348">heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">信笺，是心的一块拼图</span></p><p begin="57.554" end="1:00.435" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.554" end="57.723">That&apos;s</span> <span begin="57.723" end="58.079">where</span> <span begin="58.079" end="58.468">the</span> <span begin="58.468" end="59.636">story</span> <span begin="59.636" end="1:00.243">begin</span><span begin="1:00.243" end="1:00.435">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那是故事最初的样子</span></p><p begin="1:00.698" end="1:01.888" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.698" end="1:01.098">Here</span> <span begin="1:01.098" end="1:01.463">you</span> <span begin="1:01.463" end="1:01.888">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">交予你吧</span></p><p begin="1:01.838" end="1:04.471" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:01.838" end="1:02.619">Wow</span> <span begin="1:02.619" end="1:03.361">Wow</span> <span begin="1:03.361" end="1:04.101">oh</span> <span begin="1:04.101" end="1:04.471">oh</span></p><p begin="1:04.091" end="1:04.861" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.091" end="1:04.276">My</span> <span begin="1:04.276" end="1:04.861">dear</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的挚爱</span></p><p begin="1:04.858" end="1:07.491" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:04.858" end="1:05.638">Wow</span> <span begin="1:05.638" end="1:06.402">Wow</span> <span begin="1:06.402" end="1:06.718">oh</span> <span begin="1:06.718" end="1:07.086">oh</span> <span begin="1:07.086" end="1:07.491">oh</span></p><p begin="1:06.792" end="1:09.523" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.792" end="1:07.070">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:07.070" end="1:07.492">the</span> <span begin="1:07.492" end="1:08.532">color</span> <span begin="1:08.532" end="1:08.720">of</span> <span begin="1:08.720" end="1:09.047">the</span> <span begin="1:09.047" end="1:09.523">love</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">它浸透着爱的暖红</span></p><p begin="1:09.523" end="1:12.368" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.523" end="1:09.723">Some</span><span begin="1:09.723" end="1:10.088">times</span> <span begin="1:10.088" end="1:10.453">the</span> <span begin="1:10.453" end="1:11.373">color</span> <span begin="1:11.373" end="1:11.633">of</span> <span begin="1:11.633" end="1:11.848">the</span> <span begin="1:11.848" end="1:12.368">tears</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有时也晕出泪的湛蓝</span></p><p begin="1:12.723" end="1:15.360" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.723" end="1:13.333">Every</span> <span begin="1:13.333" end="1:13.819">shade</span> <span begin="1:13.819" end="1:14.324">lives</span> <span begin="1:14.324" end="1:14.779">inside</span> <span begin="1:14.779" end="1:14.887">the</span> <span begin="1:14.887" end="1:15.360">heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但每一抹色泽都勾勒出心底的轮廓</span></p><p begin="1:15.348" end="1:18.188" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.348" end="1:15.513">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:15.513" end="1:16.148">send</span> <span begin="1:16.148" end="1:16.308">them</span> <span begin="1:16.308" end="1:16.846">far</span> <span begin="1:16.846" end="1:17.079">and</span> <span begin="1:17.079" end="1:17.608">any</span><span begin="1:17.608" end="1:18.188">where</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我会将它们寄往远方，送至天涯</span></p><p begin="1:18.383" end="1:20.728" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.383" end="1:19.201">Any</span><span begin="1:19.201" end="1:20.728">where</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">飞往天际</span></p><p begin="1:19.829" end="1:22.489" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:19.829" end="1:20.619">Wow</span> <span begin="1:20.619" end="1:21.349">Wow</span> <span begin="1:21.349" end="1:22.114">oh</span> <span begin="1:22.114" end="1:22.489">oh</span></p><p begin="1:22.849" end="1:25.499" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:22.849" end="1:23.604">Wow</span> <span begin="1:23.604" end="1:24.369">Wow</span> <span begin="1:24.369" end="1:24.714">oh</span> <span begin="1:24.714" end="1:25.109">oh</span> <span begin="1:25.109" end="1:25.499">oh</span></p><p begin="1:25.829" end="1:28.494" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:25.829" end="1:26.594">Wow</span> <span begin="1:26.594" end="1:27.339">Wow</span> <span begin="1:27.339" end="1:28.124">oh</span> <span begin="1:28.124" end="1:28.494">oh</span></p><p begin="1:28.839" end="1:31.484" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:28.839" end="1:29.624">Wow</span> <span begin="1:29.624" end="1:30.354">Wow</span> <span begin="1:30.354" end="1:30.714">oh</span> <span begin="1:30.714" end="1:31.104">oh</span> <span begin="1:31.104" end="1:31.484">oh</span></p><p begin="1:31.692" end="1:34.498" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.692" end="1:31.858">I</span> <span begin="1:31.858" end="1:32.058">knew</span> <span begin="1:32.058" end="1:32.265">one</span> <span begin="1:32.265" end="1:32.613">day</span> <span begin="1:32.613" end="1:32.788">it</span> <span begin="1:32.788" end="1:33.205">all</span> <span begin="1:33.205" end="1:33.547">would</span> <span begin="1:33.547" end="1:33.939">fade</span> <span begin="1:33.939" end="1:34.498">away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道这酸涩的橘子味终会消褪</span></p><p begin="1:34.866" end="1:36.539" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.866" end="1:35.228">Deep</span> <span begin="1:35.228" end="1:35.405">down</span> <span begin="1:35.405" end="1:35.577">I</span> <span begin="1:35.577" end="1:36.184">always</span> <span begin="1:36.184" end="1:36.539">knew</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道所有旅行都会走到终点</span></p><p begin="1:37.656" end="1:41.189" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.656" end="1:38.013">Still</span> <span begin="1:38.013" end="1:38.409">I</span> <span begin="1:38.409" end="1:38.589">live</span> <span begin="1:38.589" end="1:38.766">on</span> <span begin="1:38.766" end="1:39.155">with</span> <span begin="1:39.155" end="1:39.333">all</span> <span begin="1:39.333" end="1:39.520">the</span> <span begin="1:39.520" end="1:40.135">strength</span> <span begin="1:40.135" end="1:40.308">I</span> <span begin="1:40.308" end="1:41.189">have</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可我依然用尽全力活着</span></p><p begin="1:42.586" end="1:45.342" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:42.586" end="1:43.036">Because</span> <span begin="1:43.036" end="1:43.266">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:43.266" end="1:43.506">the</span> <span begin="1:43.506" end="1:44.611">only</span> <span begin="1:44.611" end="1:45.342">one</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">只因我，独一无二</span></p><p begin="1:45.342" end="1:48.322" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.342" end="1:45.695">I&apos;ll</span> <span begin="1:45.695" end="1:46.096">take</span> <span begin="1:46.096" end="1:46.457">who</span><span begin="1:46.457" end="1:47.170">ever</span> <span begin="1:47.170" end="1:47.602">I</span> <span begin="1:47.602" end="1:48.322">am</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">接纳已成为过去的自己</span></p><p begin="1:48.703" end="1:53.539" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:48.703" end="1:48.863">I</span> <span begin="1:48.863" end="1:49.072">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:49.072" end="1:49.862">ever</span> <span begin="1:49.862" end="1:50.023">give</span> <span begin="1:50.023" end="1:50.623">up</span> <span begin="1:50.623" end="1:50.783">on</span> <span begin="1:50.783" end="1:51.323">who</span> <span begin="1:51.323" end="1:51.753">I</span> <span begin="1:51.753" end="1:52.096">will</span> <span begin="1:52.096" end="1:53.539">be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">追逐存在于未来的自己</span></p><p begin="1:54.371" end="2:00.411" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.371" end="1:54.743">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:54.743" end="1:55.083">my</span> <span begin="1:55.083" end="1:55.493">life,</span><span begin="1:55.493" end="1:56.057">I</span> <span begin="1:56.057" end="1:56.599">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:56.599" end="1:57.324">want</span> <span begin="1:57.324" end="1:58.165">to</span> <span begin="1:58.165" end="1:58.505">live</span> <span begin="1:58.505" end="1:59.080">with</span> <span begin="1:59.080" end="2:00.411">regrets</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这就是我的生活，不想留有遗憾！</span></p><p begin="2:00.585" end="2:03.351" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:00.585" end="2:00.780">All</span> <span begin="2:00.780" end="2:01.077">words</span> <span begin="2:01.077" end="2:01.239">are</span> <span begin="2:01.239" end="2:01.432">the</span> <span begin="2:01.432" end="2:02.066">spells</span> <span begin="2:02.066" end="2:02.431">of</span> <span begin="2:02.431" end="2:03.351">magic</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">每一个词都拼凑出魔法的咒语</span></p><p begin="2:03.571" end="2:06.532" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:03.571" end="2:03.741">Where</span> <span begin="2:03.741" end="2:04.506">courage</span> <span begin="2:04.506" end="2:05.076">first</span> <span begin="2:05.076" end="2:05.867">takes</span> <span begin="2:05.867" end="2:06.532">flight</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那是勇气初航的地方</span></p><p begin="2:06.742" end="2:07.878" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.742" end="2:07.097">Step</span> <span begin="2:07.097" end="2:07.878">forward</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">踏出这一步</span></p><p begin="2:07.878" end="2:10.483" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:07.878" end="2:08.588">Wow</span> <span begin="2:08.588" end="2:09.383">Wow</span> <span begin="2:09.383" end="2:10.103">oh</span> <span begin="2:10.103" end="2:10.483">oh</span></p><p begin="2:10.198" end="2:10.684" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:10.198" end="2:10.319">With</span> <span begin="2:10.319" end="2:10.684">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">同我一起</span></p><p begin="2:10.823" end="2:13.443" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:10.823" end="2:11.578">Wow</span> <span begin="2:11.578" end="2:12.375">Wow</span> <span begin="2:12.375" end="2:12.698">oh</span> <span begin="2:12.698" end="2:13.063">oh</span> <span begin=